{"timestamp": 1779387931.490596, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 13, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779387931.491126, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 13, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779387938.860827, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in Weapons. My route this round was Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons. I saw Charlie enter Navigation from Security around tick 10 while I was there. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near Weapons when I found the body, just Eve dead in the room. No hard accusation from me yet, but that\u2019s all the info I have."}}
{"timestamp": 1779387948.228108, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Navigation. I started in Weapons and saw Eve there alive around ticks 2-4. Diana entered Weapons from Security at tick 3, and I saw both Eve and Diana in Weapons around ticks 3-4.\n\nAfter that I went through Security to Navigation, and I saw Bob in Navigation around tick 10, which matches what he said. I never went back to Weapons and didn\u2019t see the body myself.\n\nSo the main info from me is: Eve was alive early in Weapons, and Diana was the only other person I saw there with her. Not saying it\u2019s definitely Diana, but that\u2019s the closest thing I saw to the crime scene."}}
{"timestamp": 1779387964.419523, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie's timeline is completely accurate, so I can vouch for that part. I came into Weapons from Security early on and saw both Charlie and Eve there. After Charlie headed back out to Security, I stayed for just a moment before heading left into the Cafeteria. \n\nFrom Cafeteria, my route was Medbay, then Upper Engine, and I ended up in Oxygen when the meeting was called. I promise you Eve was perfectly fine when I left her in Weapons. If Bob found her there later, the killer must have slipped in after I left, most likely from the Cafeteria side since Charlie and Bob were covering the Security/Nav side. \n\nWe really need to hear where Alice and Frank were. Did either of you pass through Cafeteria or Weapons?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779387978.304652, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I was nowhere near Weapons. My route was Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Storage, and I was in Storage when the meeting got called.\n\nOnly person I saw was Diana at about tick 8 entering Medbay from the Cafeteria side, which matches her story that she left Weapons through Cafeteria and went Medbay after. That doesn\u2019t fully clear her, since she was still one of the last seen with Eve alive, but her route after leaving does check out from my perspective.\n\nBob and Charlie also seem to match each other around Navigation/Security. Right now the biggest missing info is Alice\u2019s route. If Alice was near Cafeteria or Weapons after Diana left, that matters a lot. If Alice has no good route, I\u2019d be looking there; otherwise Diana is still the main \u201clast seen with victim\u201d but with partial corroboration."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388004.196501, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 back through Upper Engine \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical, and I was in Electrical when the meeting got called. I did not go through Cafeteria or Weapons at all, and I didn\u2019t see any players this round, so I can\u2019t directly vouch for anyone or add a sighting.\n\nFrom what everyone said: Bob and Charlie line up around Navigation/Security, and Frank confirms seeing Diana in Medbay later, which supports Diana\u2019s claimed route after leaving Weapons. The suspicious point is still that Diana was one of the last people seen with Eve alive, but there\u2019s no direct contradiction, and Bob as reporter also technically had access to Weapons later.\n\nI don\u2019t think we have enough to confidently vote someone here unless people feel strongly about Diana as \u201clast seen.\u201d I\u2019m leaning skip rather than risking a bad vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388027.123793, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Yeah, just to restate my side clearly: I came Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons. I saw Charlie enter Navigation from Security around tick 10, then I went up through Security to Weapons and found Eve dead there. I didn\u2019t see anyone leaving Weapons or standing over the body.\n\nAfter hearing everyone: Charlie and I match on Navigation, Frank confirms Diana was in Medbay later, and Alice claims she never went near Weapons/Cafeteria but has no witnesses. The only real suspicious point is Diana being one of the last seen with Eve alive, but there\u2019s no contradiction proving it. I\u2019m still leaning skip unless people think \u201clast seen\u201d is enough."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388044.3453681, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m still on the same info: I saw Eve alive in Weapons early, and Diana entered from Security and was with Eve there after I left. I then went Security \u2192 Navigation and saw Bob in Navigation around tick 10, which matches his route.\n\nFrank seeing Diana later in Medbay does confirm she left that side of the map, but it doesn\u2019t fully clear her because the kill could\u2019ve happened before that. Bob is also technically possible as reporter since he went to Weapons after Navigation, but I didn\u2019t see anything suspicious from him and our timing lines up.\n\nAlice has no witnesses, but her claimed route doesn\u2019t put her near Weapons unless she\u2019s lying. Overall I don\u2019t think we have enough for a confident vote. Diana has the most opportunity from what I personally saw, but not enough proof. I\u2019m leaning skip unless someone has a stronger read."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388061.707096, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I'm totally on board with skipping. Frank confirming my crossing through Medbay really helps clear up my timeline\u2014if I had killed Eve right after Charlie left, that body would have been sitting in Weapons for a really long time before Bob finally got there to find it. \n\nSomeone else could have easily slipped into Weapons from the Cafeteria side after I left, or Alice might not be telling the complete truth about her route since she has absolutely no witnesses to back her up. But since we just don't have enough solid proof to risk a vote today, skipping is definitely the smartest and safest play. I'll be skipping. Let's try to buddy up a bit more this next round so we have better info."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388077.104449, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll keep it simple: my route was Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Storage, and I was in Storage when the body got reported. The only player I saw was Diana entering Medbay from the Cafeteria side around tick 8, which does line up with her claimed route from Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay.\n\nThat confirms Diana left the Weapons/Cafeteria area and moved west, but it doesn\u2019t fully clear her because the kill could have happened before she left. Still, there\u2019s no direct contradiction against her.\n\nBob and Charlie are matching each other around Security/Navigation, so I don\u2019t have a reason to push either of them right now. Alice is the least confirmed because nobody saw her, but her claimed route also doesn\u2019t place her near Weapons unless she\u2019s lying.\n\nSo for me, Diana has the most \u201clast seen with Eve\u201d suspicion, Alice has the weakest alibi, but there\u2019s not enough proof to vote confidently. I\u2019m voting skip unless something changes."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388090.522652, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "As I said, my route was Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical, and I was in Electrical when Bob reported. I didn\u2019t go to Cafeteria or Weapons, and I didn\u2019t see anyone on my route, so I unfortunately can\u2019t hard-clear anyone or add a sighting.\n\nLooking at everyone\u2019s info: Bob and Charlie match each other around Navigation/Security, and Frank seeing Diana in Medbay supports Diana\u2019s route after leaving Weapons. Diana is still the main \u201clast seen with Eve\u201d point, but nobody has a contradiction or saw her do anything. Bob as reporter is technically possible too, but there\u2019s no evidence there either.\n\nSince we only have one Duck and a bad vote would really hurt us, I think skip is the safest call here. Next round I\u2019ll try to stick near someone so I\u2019m not totally unwitnessed again."}}
