{"timestamp": 1779388244.329476, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I reported Alice\u2019s body in Electrical. My route this round was Navigation -> Security -> Electrical. I found Alice dead right inside Electrical near the task panels; I didn\u2019t see who killed her.\n\nEarlier, I saw Eve in Weapons around ticks 2-4, and Diana was also in Weapons around ticks 3-4. Later I saw Bob in Navigation around tick 10. I didn\u2019t see Frank this round, and I never saw Alice alive before finding the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388261.183145, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie is right about the early game, I was up near Weapons and saw Eve there around tick 4 or 5. After that, I made my way down through Cafeteria and into Electrical. \n\nI actually saw Alice in Electrical! She was alive and doing tasks when I passed through. I left her there and went straight into Medbay to work on my scan task, and that's where I was when the meeting was called. \n\nSince Charlie found the body in Electrical right after, the killer must have slipped in right after I left, or maybe they vented in. I didn't see anyone else in the hallway between Medbay and Electrical. \n\nFrank, we haven't heard from you and Charlie didn't see you at all. Where have you been this whole round?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779388287.9488041, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I was not near Electrical this round. My route was Storage -> Lower Engine -> Upper Engine, and I was in Upper Engine when the report happened. I didn\u2019t see Alice, Diana, or Frank at all.\n\nI did see Charlie around Navigation at about tick 10, so that lines up with Charlie saying they came from Navigation toward Security/Electrical. That doesn\u2019t fully clear Charlie, but the route makes sense.\n\nRight now the key info is Diana says she saw Alice alive in Electrical and left to Medbay, then Charlie finds Alice dead in Electrical after coming from Security. So the main window is between Diana leaving and Charlie reporting. That makes Diana and Charlie the closest to the kill, unless Frank was hiding around that side and hasn\u2019t said anything.\n\nFrank, we really need your route. If you can\u2019t place yourself away from Electrical, that\u2019s suspicious. I\u2019m not ready to hard vote yet without hearing him, but Diana being last to see Alice alive is important."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388309.2793422, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was Upper Engine straight to Oxygen, and I\u2019ve been on the O2 filter task. I never went near Electrical this round and I didn\u2019t see Alice, Charlie, or Bob.\n\nThe only person I saw was Diana in Medbay around tick 8, which does line up with her saying she left Electrical and went to Medbay. That doesn\u2019t hard clear her, because she was still last to see Alice alive, but it does support that part of her story.\n\nFrom what we have: Bob\u2019s route is away from Electrical, Charlie is confirmed near Navigation by Bob then reports in Electrical, and Diana was in the Electrical/Medbay area right before the body. So the kill window is really between Diana leaving Alice and Charlie finding her. I think the main suspects are Diana or Charlie, with Charlie having the report and Diana being last with Alice. I\u2019m leaning slightly Charlie if Diana really was in Medbay when I saw her, but I\u2019m not 100% sure."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388330.446872, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I want to point out one thing: Bob\u2019s story doesn\u2019t really add up to me. He says his route was Storage -> Lower Engine -> Upper Engine and that he wasn\u2019t near Electrical, but he also says he saw me in Navigation around tick 10. I did see Bob in Navigation, so that part is true \u2014 but then his claimed route is missing Navigation entirely.\n\nFrom Navigation, it\u2019s not that far to Security and then Electrical. So Bob actually did have a path toward the body area, despite saying he was away from it.\n\nDiana is definitely in the area too, and she was last to see Alice alive, but Frank says he saw Diana in Medbay, which supports her story at least somewhat. I reported the body, so I know I look close, but I came from Navigation through Security and found Alice already dead in Electrical.\n\nRight now I\u2019m most suspicious of Bob because of the route contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388348.649819, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "\"Wow, Charlie is absolutely right. Good catch! Bob, you completely contradicted yourself. You claimed you went Storage -> Lower Engine -> Upper Engine and that you were nowhere near the right side of the map, but then you said you saw Charlie in Navigation at tick 10? Navigation is totally out of your way and right next to the Security/Electrical area! \n\nFrank confirmed he saw me in Medbay, which perfectly matches my story of leaving Electrical before the kill happened. Charlie is the one who reported it. Bob, it looks like you slipped up and tried to distance yourself from the body while accidentally admitting you were nearby. I'm voting for Bob.\""}}
{"timestamp": 1779388392.091614, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "You\u2019re right to call out the route issue \u2014 I misspoke and left out the Navigation part. Full clarification: I was around Navigation when I saw Charlie, then I went away from that side through Storage -> Lower Engine -> Upper Engine. I never went into Security or Electrical, and I was in Upper Engine when the report happened.\n\nCharlie using that as a \u201cgotcha\u201d feels a little opportunistic to me. Yes, I was in Navigation, but Charlie was also there and then says they went directly Security -> Electrical, which is literally the route to the body. If Charlie saw me in Navigation, then Charlie knows I left that area instead of going toward Electrical.\n\nDiana is still not fully cleared \u2014 last to see Alice alive matters \u2014 but Frank seeing Diana in Medbay supports her being out of Electrical at least at that time. Charlie is the one whose path goes straight from Navigation to Security to Electrical, then reports the body. I think Charlie is the stronger suspect here than Diana or Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388447.201576, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll clarify my part again: I was Upper Engine to Oxygen, doing O2. I didn\u2019t go near Electrical. The only useful sighting I had was Diana in Medbay around tick 8, which does support her saying she left Electrical and went there \u2014 but I agree it doesn\u2019t 100% clear her.\n\nFor me, the biggest issue is Bob\u2019s first route. He said Storage -> Lower Engine -> Upper Engine and \u201cnot near Electrical,\u201d but then also said he saw Charlie in Navigation. That\u2019s not a small detail to leave out, because Navigation is on the right side and gives access toward Security/Electrical. His correction could be honest, but it also looks like he was trying to distance himself from the body area.\n\nCharlie\u2019s path does go straight to the body, so I\u2019m not hard-clearing Charlie either. But Charlie reported and caught the contradiction. Diana was last near Alice, but I can at least confirm she was in Medbay after that.\n\nRight now I think Bob has the worst story. I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
